  m_text: '<b>Hero</b> - Adventurer Hero by STAEL

    <b>Forest, ruins, dragon</b>
    - Pixel Art Platformer Asset Pack by Glax (CC0)

    <b>Castle</b> - Spooky Castle
    Tileset (OpenGameArt)

    <b>Enemies</b> - 2D Platformer Enemies (OpenGameArt)

    <b>Gems</b>
    - Cave Platformer Tileset by Rotting Pixels

    <b>Keys</b> - CC0 Key Icons
    by 7Soul1

    <b>Chests</b> - Animated Pixel Art Treasure Chests by Yevhen Babiichuk
    (DustDFG), CC-BY 4.0

    <b>Portals</b> - Portals (OpenGameArt)

    <b>Music</b>
    - "8-bit Perilous Dungeon" & "8-bit Slay the Evil" by HydroGene, "Spooky Dungeon"
    by Memoraphile

    <b>Sound effects</b> - Kenney Impact & Interface Sounds (CC0)


    Full
    details: Docs/ASSET_CREDITS.md'
